      "headline": "S\u00e1nchez hosts global progressive summit in Barcelona, Spain-Mexico ties restored after years of colonial-history freeze",
      "summary": "Prime Minister S\u00e1nchez organised the IV Global Progressive Mobilisation in Barcelona (Apr 17-18), gathering leaders including Brazil's Lula, Mexico's Sheinbaum, Colombia's Petro, South Africa's Ramaphosa, and Uruguay's Orsi. The summit, billed as a left-wing counterpart to CPAC and explicitly anti-Trump in framing, also hosted the first Spanish-Brazilian bilateral summit and culminated in a personal meeting between S\u00e1nchez and Sheinbaum that formally resolved years of diplomatic friction over Spain's colonial past, with Sheinbaum declaring there had 'never been a diplomatic crisis.'",
