      "headline": "Venezuela opposition leader Machado visits Madrid: embraced by PP and Vox, rebuffs meeting with S\u00e1nchez",
      "summary": "Venezuelan Nobel Peace laureate and opposition leader Mar\u00eda Corina Machado visited Madrid over April 17-19, drawing a rally of several thousand at Puerta del Sol and meeting with PP leader Feij\u00f3o, Vox leader Abascal, Madrid president Ayuso (who awarded her the Comunidad de Madrid Gold Medal), and Madrid mayor Almeida (who awarded her the city's Golden Key). Machado declined a meeting with Prime Minister S\u00e1nchez, who confirmed the invitation was offered and rebuffed; Felipe VI had earlier sent her a private congratulatory letter on her Nobel prize.",
